# This directory tracks proptest regression cases for deterministic CI replay.
#
# proptest writes shrunk counterexamples here automatically when a property test fails.
# Committing this directory means discovered cases replay on the same seed in CI
# rather than silently changing between runs (ROBUST-03 / T-03-07).
#
# Do NOT gitignore this directory.
# When a test failure is found and a regression file appears here, commit it so
# the counterexample is stable across CI runs and local runs.
